<h1>About &amp; events</h1>
<p>Psionica is a small travelling bookshop for the esoteric, art and tekh: occult and earth mysteries, psychedelia, visionary art, rave and sound-system culture, cyberculture, and the magazines that went with them.</p>
<p>Most stock is secondhand, one copy of each. Everything listed here is also on the table when we set up a stall.</p>

<h2>Where to find us</h2>
<p>No stalls booked yet. Upcoming events will be listed here.</p>

<h2>Postage</h2>
<p>Orders go out by Royal Mail within two working days, in board-backed mailers. UK only for now.</p>

